---
description: Database safety requirements
alwaysApply: true
---

NEVER destructively alter the production schema unless explicitly approved.

For feature development:
- Prefer additive migrations.
- Never drop existing tables or columns.
- Never rename existing production columns without a migration strategy.
- Never delete or rewrite existing records.
- Preserve tenant_id ownership.
- Preserve existing APIs and workflows.
- New features must remain compatible with old records.
- All multi-record activation workflows must be transactional.
- Cross-tenant references are forbidden.
- Check existing schema before creating new entities.
- Do not create duplicate concepts already represented in the database.
